    narr:narration """This actor hub holds two registers. The long spine is [a single assertion repeated near-daily](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788169170042_1) from the first dated entry through [the latest repetition](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1790155536514_1), with [an alternate dated log](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2E2EDefaultRef1788341794428_1) in the same cadence — claim-level conviction in a concrete, present-tense, realis frame throughout. On the final dated days a second register appears: [a ruling issued in an owner capacity](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_1), its substance — [one bundle per run per person](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2) — argued in plain-spoken antithesis, [a boundary held against pushback](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3), and [a rejected alternative recorded with its reason](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5), now also carried under [her own signature on the same rejected-alternative record](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_4) and re-voiced in [a second-pass retelling of the ruling](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_1) with [the directive restated](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_2), [the pushback narrated as relayed](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_3), and [the rejection re-reported](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_4). A query for anything beyond the repeated assertion and this delivery-routing decision is honestly not-here.""" ;
    narr:reaction """What moved since you last reviewed: the delivery-routing ruling gained a [second-pass retelling](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_1) — the directive, the pushback, and the rejected alternative are now doubled rather than single-sourced, and the pushback's authority-ranking is explicitly marked [relayed](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_3) in that version. The [rejected-alternative record](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_4) also now carries her own signature alongside [Tina's](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_3). The long repeated-assertion spine itself did not move — it simply extended through the latest dated day.""" ;
